    "scientificReading": "For this stated surfactant terminology, microbial structural transformation must result in loss of surface activity. A bare parent-removal percentage with no validated method or functional evidence is insufficient. Ultimate aerobic degradation additionally concerns biological conversion and carbon fate; parent loss does not quantify mineralisation.",
    "methodBoundary": "Validated surfactant-specific analytical assays may establish the relevant loss; the review does not require a separate surface-tension instrument in every possible method."
